4. Bundled in the Setu images (not in this tree): Wine Mono
   ---------------------------------------------------------
   The disk images and the installer ISO that distro/ builds include Wine
   Mono 10.4.1 (https://gitlab.winehq.org/mono/wine-mono), the .NET
   Framework replacement that Wine 11.0's mscoree.dll loads, installed
   unmodified in /opt/setu/personality/share/wine/mono. It is downloaded
   from dl.winehq.org at build time (pinned by SHA-256) and never stored in
   this repository. Wine Mono's own code is under the MIT License; parts of
   it are under the GPL and the LGPL (Mono), and its components carry
   their own licences (MIT, MS-PL, zlib, BSD; see Wine Mono's COPYING).
   Its source code: https://dl.winehq.org/wine/wine-mono/10.4.1/
   wine-mono-10.4.1-src.tar.xz. Among its MIT-licensed components are
   open-source .NET libraries published by Microsoft (WinForms, WPF); they
   come with Wine Mono as released and are not part of Setu's source.

