9. Built into the personality (not in this tree): ICU
   ---------------------------------------------------
   The personality build, and so the Setu images, include ICU 72.1
   (International Components for Unicode, https://icu.unicode.org/) as the
   system DLLs icu.dll, icuuc.dll and icuin.dll (tools/build-icu.sh,
   tools/icu/README.md). They are compiled, unmodified apart from the
   build configuration, from the upstream source release
   https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/releases/download/release-72-1/icu4c-72_1-src.tgz
   (downloaded at build time, pinned by SHA-256, never stored in this
   repository), and include its prebuilt data (Unicode CLDR). ICU is
   Copyright (c) Unicode, Inc. and others, under the Unicode License
   (Unicode-DFS-2016, https://www.unicode.org/copyright.html); parts are
   under the other permissive licences listed in its LICENSE file, which
   is installed next to the DLLs as share/wine/icu/LICENSE.

